  "prompt": "Trong Hình 5 , ba điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> nằm ở đầu các cánh quạt của tua-bin gió. Biết các cánh quạt dài <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>31</mn></semantics></math> m, độ cao của điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> so với mặt đất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>30</mn></semantics></math> m, góc giữa các cánh quạt là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></semantics></math> và số đo góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>α</mi></semantics></math>.\n\t<ul><li>Tính <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tính <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>sin</mo></semantics></math> của các góc lượng giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, từ đó tính chiều cao của các điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> so với mặt đất (theo đơn vị mét). Làm tròn kết quả đến hàng phần trăm.</li></ul>\n\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/2a7446ad861b9624f08c0e87f48c1a97558112e49be79125af3e0731d4025d1a.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>",
  "choices": [],
  "correct": null,
  "solution": "<ul><li>Ta có tọa độ điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> trong hệ trục tọa độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>30</mn><mn>31</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>61</mn></msqrt><mn>31</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>cos</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>sin</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>cos</mo><mi>α</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>30</mn><mn>31</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>61</mn></msqrt><mn>31</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>183</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>62</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tDo đó chiều cao của điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> so với mặt đất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>183</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>62</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>76</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tương tự, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Suy ra <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>cos</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>sin</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>cos</mo><mi>α</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>30</mn><mn>31</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>61</mn></msqrt><mn>31</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>183</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>62</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tDo đó chiều cao của điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math> so với mặt đất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>183</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>62</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>68</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>24</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>",
